## SQ-PRI-01 | Brewin' tags moved to CD; emptied pack scripts silent
@group A
@commands (r1101 PASS; no 'Supreme Pizza' item exists, use `brewinandchewin:pizza`; the two emptied scripts are comment-only stubs, not empty files) `/dumptags`; grep latest.log for `brewinandchewin/tags.js`, `Error occurred while handling event`; `kubejs/server_scripts/tags/cookingtags.js` and `cooking/cooking.js` are now empty files
@pass `#brewinandchewin:cooked_horror_lasagna_meats` holds beef, mutton, beef patty, cooked mutton chops; the soup-veggie cooked tag holds kimchi; the pizza topping tag holds the bell peppers; no tag or recipe error from the two emptied scripts; Supreme Pizza, Ham and Cheese Sandwich, Scarlet Pierogi recipes still load (recipe dump)
@fails CD `brewinandchewin/tags.js` / `recipes.js` `requires` header; a stale copy of the old scripts
@from batches/r1101/p1_server.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> cdevtest tag item brewinandchewin:cooked_horror_lasagna_meats
> cdevtest tagsof farmersdelight:beef_patty
> cdevtest tagsof brewinandchewin:kimchi
> cdevtest tagsof vintagedelight:green_bell_pepper
