@@text Live checks waiting for a bulk scratch-server session. A bulk session groups the entries by world group, runs each
@@text group on one server (`tools/creative_labels_test/scratch_server.sh`, memory `scratch-server-verify`), then marks
@@text each entry PASS / FAIL here and moves the result into the feature's writeup. One game JVM at a time: check
@@text `pgrep -c java` is 0 before booting (never `pgrep -af`).
@@text
